cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these runs, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "Certifying smoke runs of study: does a coding agent's model need to re-read its own reasoning?"
authors:
  - family-names: Mehta
    given-names: Achint
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-4192-8750"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/achintmehta/model-reasoning-visibility-study-smoke-runs"
abstract: >-
  The certifying smoke set of study: 66 agent runs by eight open-weight models,
  made on 2026-10-07 from harness commit 5ac366f4175dc0929c28ad45e1560d26760f83fa,
  with the gate script that certified them. Not study data: the protocol excludes
  every smoke run from analysis.
keywords:
  - coding agents
